  "implementation": [
    "Step and return await exact book/contentVersion/mode/unit/CFI persistence.",
    "Post-configuration position failures do not poison the entire mode revision.",
    "Explicit next calls can retry an existing failed position; fresh failures reject the current call.",
    "Equivalent replacement waits for newest receipt; changed target, retirement and cancellation reject obsolete waiters.",
    "Return history commits after persistence; steps do not add jump history.",
    "Automatic playback stops on a failed next-unit save."
  ],
